5. Frequency-based and atom group counts: Attributes such as nArCOOR (Number of aromatic esters), nCb- (Number of substituted benzene C(sp2)), NssssC (Number of atoms of type ssssC), and F03[C-O] (Frequency of C-O bonds at topological distance 3) signify structural features impacting biodegradability.

